{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PushPush Demo\u00a0</strong>is a desktop idle balloon-pumping game! Keep inflating balloons, unlock adorable cats, and discover quirky pumping tools and fun combinations. Perfect for daily relaxation and stress relief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of items available in the demo is limited. The full release will bring you a wider variety of items and game content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Pumping</strong>: Click like crazy to inflate balloons, cut the pump at the right time, and be careful\u2014balloons might explode anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056240/extras/f1fba0aa621291ec919bb6e61dc438d5.poster.avif?t=1759319898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056240/extras/f1fba0aa621291ec919bb6e61dc438d5.webm?t=1759319898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056240/extras/f1fba0aa621291ec919bb6e61dc438d5.mp4?t=1759319898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Cats</strong>: Unlock all kinds of cute cats while upgrading your pumping power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056240/extras/38521311b9b374c36e4637a12e7177fa.poster.avif?t=1759319898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056240/extras/38521311b9b374c36e4637a12e7177fa.webm?t=1759319898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat